    "summary": "Summary: Goal containers are now excluded from dispatch, gating, merging, reconciliation, auto-fix, and worker result paths. Closable discovery supports goal-marked execute containers and requires every execute child to be merged.\n\nFiles changed: 8 scoped files, including new `docs/orchestrator-goals.md`.\n\nGate result: **RED** after the permitted two runs. The five named acceptance tests pass after the final fix. Worktree is clean.\n\nCommit: `d0611d7542f852f4b3bab932a8dab6f4c0fc4621`\n\nFailures-only test output from the last gate:\n\n```text\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n    raise RuntimeError(\"boom\")\nRuntimeError: boom\nERROR: test_goal_child_is_gated_while_goal_is_queued (test_daemon.GoalContainers.test_goal_child_is_gated_while_goal_is_queued)\nTraceback (most recent call last):\nTypeError: 'Mock' object is not iterable\nERROR: test_cli_exit_code_and_persisted_result (test_skill_eval.SkillEvalTests.test_cli_exit_code_and_persisted_result)\nTraceback (most recent call last):\nFAIL: test_suite_covers_all_p36_groups_and_passes (test_skill_eval.SkillEvalTests.test_suite_covers_all_p36_groups_and_passes)\nTraceback (most recent call last):\nAssertionError: False is not true : group\tresult\tchecks\nCompaction\tFAIL\toutput contract preserved\nFAILED (failures=1, errors=2)\n```\n\nThe direct mock error shown above was subsequently fixed; all five acceptance tests then passed via unittest.",
